<p>Israeli airstrikes across the Gaza Strip killed at least 11 Palestinians on Sunday, according to Palestinian health officials and civil defence, with strikes reported in Jabaliya in the north and Khan Younis in the south. Palestinian medics said one strike hit a tent encampment sheltering displaced families.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/VY8iLzh8smuNdWEN7CDUMtfxwqkFw5v50hHdLsUDN6zXR9KUZzInSiVNgo23OzGG00Ad-i2iAeeqGJXif_xzlldJzNgNYzxIxMgWwKSw6sWSCuXrP6qjXPAroMC9VUWJN9pLBsH8ai3a3VH9l1h3ZOJxArINNHXCTpSeBJlyGgcXNlVBDo-KDu7_vjRhN6SEhum4AtzYDVXQSVIzOqYGF-8' alt='Aftermath scene in Gaza following reported Israeli strikes.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Jabaliya tent strike: Gaza’s civil defence said an airstrike hit a tent sheltering displaced people in Jabaliya, killing five and injuring several others.</li><li>Khan Younis deaths: Palestinian health officials said a separate strike killed five people in Khan Younis in southern Gaza.</li><li>Additional fatality reported: Reuters said another person was shot dead in the north, separate from the deaths attributed to the airstrikes.</li><li>Who was killed: The BBC said those killed included “several militants,” along with other Palestinians.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Israeli military: Israel said it carried out the airstrikes in response to what it described as ceasefire/truce violations by Hamas. (<a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/02/israeli-airstrikes-kill-11-gaza-palestinians-say-israel-says-hamas-violated-truce'>Al-Monitor (via Reuters)</a>)</li><li>Hamas: Hamas condemned the strikes, calling them a “massacre” of displaced people. (<a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/feb/15/palestinians-killed-injured-gaza-israeli-airstrikes-hamas'>The Guardian</a>)</li><li>Gaza civil defence and medics: Local responders and health officials said the strikes hit several areas, including a tent encampment for displaced families, and reported multiple deaths. (<a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/several-killed-israeli-strike-gaza-strip-updates-february-15/article70634999.ece'>The Hindu</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/several-killed-israeli-strike-gaza-strip-updates-february-15/article70634999.ece'>Israeli airstrikes kill 12 in Gaza, Palestinians say; Israel says Hamas violated truce</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/feb/15/palestinians-killed-injured-gaza-israeli-airstrikes-hamas'>At least 12 Palestinians killed and several hurt in Israeli airstrikes on Gaza</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.firstpost.com/world/israel-strikes-gaza-strip-kills-11-in-response-to-hamas-ceasefire-violation-13980103.html'>Israel strikes Gaza Strip, kills 11 in ‘response to Hamas&#x27; ceasefire violation’</a> - firstpost.com</li><li><a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/02/israeli-airstrikes-kill-11-gaza-palestinians-say-israel-says-hamas-violated-truce'>Israeli airstrikes kill 11 in Gaza, Palestinians say; Israel says Hamas violated truce</a> - al-monitor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c8r15eyvk2do'>Eleven Palestinians, including several militants, are killed in Israeli strikes in Gaza.</a> - bbc.com</li></ul>